00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:06.090
I mean is it law, do you wanna like--

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:08.320
- No.
- Dad-son teach?

00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:09.410
That would be cool,
you're gettin' in on that.

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:10.307
- No no no no, I'm not
interesting in that.

00:15:10.307 --> 00:15:12.608
- Splittin' the paycheck.

00:15:12.608 --> 00:15:13.441
Splittin' the duties.

00:15:13.441 --> 00:15:15.180
- I'm very--
- Bonding with your dad.

00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:16.880
- I'm just interested in
so many different things.

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:18.710
- You have to pick something
that you're gonna teach.

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:21.030
- You know that I like paleontology,

00:15:21.030 --> 00:15:23.544
but I like that because
of the idea of the clothes

00:15:23.544 --> 00:15:26.290
and brushing the dinosaur bones.

00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:28.570
- Yeah but you're in a classroom setting.

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:31.550
- So I don't know, it's
very difficult for me

00:15:31.550 --> 00:15:33.290
to just think about it in the abstract

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:34.180
'cause I'm thinking about something

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:36.190
that I might actually
be able to talk about.

00:15:36.190 --> 00:15:38.360
Okay, for instance, you
know I took that class

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:41.037
at NC State, my favorite class
ever, the futurism class.

00:15:41.037 --> 00:15:43.284
And that professor was
just an absolute nut and--

00:15:43.284 --> 00:15:44.930
