fancy in middle school.

00:18:08.887 --> 00:18:10.083
#EarBiscuits.

00:18:11.237 --> 00:18:12.620
(whistles)

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:14.980
- I still think Lunchables
are kinda fancy.

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:17.504
- They're kinda cool, innovative.

00:18:17.504 --> 00:18:19.376
Still innovative into this day.

00:18:19.376 --> 00:18:21.500
Still feel like you're eating future food.

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:23.286
- Yeah I feel like an astronaut.

00:18:23.286 --> 00:18:25.350
