00:18:45.704 --> 00:18:47.810
- This is not a joke?
- This is not a joke.

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:50.880
He just, he'd been in space so long

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:53.870
that he hadn't gotten used to

00:18:53.870 --> 00:18:55.570
when you let something go, it falls.

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:56.403
