00:19:25.763 --> 00:19:27.792
- Yeah, seriously.

00:19:27.792 --> 00:19:30.308
Do you have something in mind?

00:19:30.308 --> 00:19:31.724
- Yeah.

00:19:31.724 --> 00:19:33.410
- I had a hard time with this one.

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:35.770
- Well I think the way
I was thinking about it,

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:37.063
you'll relate to this.

00:19:38.117 --> 00:19:40.850
I remember everything seeming fancy.

00:19:40.850 --> 00:19:44.071
Like the whole town of
Dunn seemed fancy to me.

00:19:44.071 --> 00:19:48.227
Growing up, when we went to
the Chinese restaurant in Dunn

00:19:48.227 --> 00:19:50.900
