towards the interstate.

00:19:58.276 --> 00:20:00.900
- East.
- And then you'd get to Dunn

00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:02.340
with two Ns.

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:03.610
- Yeah.
- They had a movie theater

00:20:03.610 --> 00:20:06.450
