- You told me in grade school

00:20:30.087 --> 00:20:32.640
about how you would go to Fuquay to go

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:34.556
to a Mexican restaurant and I was like--

00:20:34.556 --> 00:20:35.723
- What?
- What?

00:20:36.683 --> 00:20:38.573
I didn't understand.
- And then,

00:20:38.573 --> 00:20:40.540
once I--
- Like even in high school,

00:20:40.540 --> 00:20:42.390
I never ate at a Mexican restaurant.

00:20:42.390 --> 00:20:44.570
- But once I started
getting to know my wife

00:20:44.570 --> 00:20:46.274
and started hanging out with her family

00:20:46.274 --> 00:20:51.274
and they would go to like Maggiano's.

00:20:51.460 --> 00:20:53.850
You know what I'm saying,
we're still in chain territory.

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:57.260
- Yeah, yeah.
- But like that was like what?

00:20:57.260 --> 00:20:58.610
- Oh that was the tip-top, man.

00:20:58.610 --> 00:21:00.630
- I was like, I'd never eaten any place

00:21:00.630 --> 00:21:02.200
like this in my life.

00:21:02.200 --> 00:21:04.400
And now I'm just such a douche,
you know what I'm saying?

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:06.300
- Darryl's is the one that I would go to.

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:08.400
- Now I'm just a snob.

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:11.790
Now it's like, well I'm not
gonna eat it if it's a chain.

00:21:11.790 --> 00:21:14.320
No no, it's gotta have four
and a half stars at least.

00:21:14.320 --> 00:21:16.137
It's gotta be on the Eater LA map.

00:21:16.137 --> 00:21:17.343
- Right.

00:21:17.343 --> 00:21:19.720
- And they've gotta serve beets.

00:21:19.720 --> 00:21:23.024
And I mean cold beets in a salad.

00:21:23.024 --> 00:21:25.580
And--
- A lot of sugar in beets.

00:21:25.580 --> 00:21:27.560
Watch that.
- But yeah, growing up, man.

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:29.020
I wish I could go back to that mentality,

00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:31.866
