00:21:31.866 --> 00:21:34.480
because then everything would be amazing.

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:36.210
- You know what, you jogged my memory.

00:21:36.210 --> 00:21:38.480
The thing that I thought was fancy

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:40.193
because you would talk about it,

00:21:41.090 --> 00:21:44.490
when you went to Dunn,
that steakhouse in Dunn.

